# Act 3, chapter 10 "The Last Stand" (Age 780-785). Flags: 380 opened, 381 the rain speech, 383 Gohan defeated,
# 384 after Gohan seen, 385 finale seen, 386 the end. Areas 17:21-17:24 (West City ruins, act3 palette).
# Gohan = actor future_gohan (LoG2's one-armed Super Saiyan Future Gohan, actor 51, plus edited attack frames from
# LoG2 actor 153), stats row 23. 17:23 shows him fallen (gohan_fallen); 17:24 has Future Trunks (trunks_future, LoG2 125).
list ch10_start
set_flag 380
do call 149 1
do call 183 516 1468 1469
do call 115 0 2 0 0 0; call 121 1
do call 120 1; call 119 17 40 1 424 140; call 121 60
narrate Age 780. It has rained for three days.
narrate Thirteen years since West City. The twins look exactly the same. Everyone else has grown older, or stopped.
narrate The old circus lot on the west side is full of wrecked machines. Capsule Corporation colours. Turrets on the walls.
say android17 The resistance has been busy. Somebody wants us to come in the slow way.
say android18 Somebody's waiting for us. At the crossroads. I can feel him from here.
journal Get to the {c07}crossroads{c02}
do call 47; call 51 0
list ch10_rain
set_flag 381
narrate Someone is standing at the crossroads in the rain, his hair burning gold. His left arm ends at the shoulder.
say future_gohan.0 I left Trunks behind. Knocked him out. He's going to be so angry with me when he wakes up.
say android18 Why would you do that?
say future_gohan.1 Because somebody has to survive you two. And it isn't going to be me.
say android17 Thirteen years, and you're still the only one who fights back. I'll almost miss you.
if_flag 370 rain_paozu
goto rain_fight
label rain_paozu
say android18 ...Your mother still sets your plate out. Every night.
say future_gohan.2 You've been to my house.
say android18 She was kind to me. I don't know why.
say future_gohan.0 She's kind to everybody. That's why I can't let you near her again.
label rain_fight
say future_gohan.3 Come on. Both of you. Let's finish this.
do heal; call 120 20; call 119 17 22 1 424 440; call 121 20
journal Gohan's last stand
do call 47; call 51 0
list ch10_after
if_flag 384 after_seen
set_flag 384
narrate Gohan goes down in the middle of the crossroads, face up. The gold goes out of his hair, and the rain fills his eyes.
say future_gohan.1 Trunks... I'm sorry... I won't be there to...
narrate He doesn't finish.
say android17 Six.
say android18 Stop counting.
say android17 What?
say android18 Stop counting them. Please.
narrate Seventeen looks at her for a long moment. Then he walks off into the rain without a word.
narrate Eighteen stays. She doesn't know why. She takes off her vest and lays it over his face.
narrate An hour later, a boy with lavender hair found him there. Nobody heard what he screamed except the sky, and the sky turned gold.
do call 120 90
do call 119 17 24 1 424 440; call 121 60
stop
label after_seen
list ch10_finale
if_flag 385 finale_seen
set_flag 385
narrate Age 785. There is nothing left in the world worth breaking.
say android17 Remember when this was fun?
say android18 ...Was it ever?
narrate A light in the sky that isn't the sun. A machine settles in the street. The young man who steps out of it has a sword on his back.
say trunks_a My name is Trunks. Gohan was my teacher.
say android17 The kid from the rain. You got tall.
say trunks_b I've been to the past. I trained with my father. I've seen a world where you two never hurt anyone.
say trunks_a In that world, Eighteen... Krillin had the chance to destroy you, and he couldn't. He wished the bomb out of you instead.
say android18 ...Krillin.
narrate The short one. The one who wouldn't hit her face.
say trunks_c And you, Seventeen. The dragon brought you back, and you just walked away. No fighting. You went home.
say android17 Ha! That's the stupidest thing I've ever heard.
say trunks_d Maybe. But nobody died.
narrate Trunks draws the sword. His hair turns gold.
say trunks_c I'm sorry. In this world, it ends here.
say android18 Lapis.
say android17 Don't call me...
say android18 I remember. Her name. Our mother's name. I finally remember it.
say android17 ...Tell me later.
narrate There was no later. The light was gold, and very fast, and it didn't hurt.
set_flag 386
# narration needs a picture behind it (text over a faded-out screen doesn't show): West City's north-east blocks, the
# camera away from the player (native 115 only moves the camera)
do call 120 120; call 115 17 32 1 640 120; call 121 120
narrate Age 785. The androids are gone. For the first time in eighteen years, the sun comes up over a quiet world.
narrate Somewhere in a bunker nobody remembers, an incubator is still humming. Something inside it is waiting.
narrate End of Act Three.
# ---------- Epilogue "Another Timeline" (Age 788): 17:32 loaded with native 115, the camera on Trunks, the player
# left off screen at the 17:24 arrival point. Then the secret chapter if 18 found all three memories (341, 370, 371)
# and spared the mother and son (344); otherwise the end.
do call 120 60
do call 183 516 1470 1471
do call 115 0 2 0 0 0; call 121 1
do call 120 1; call 115 17 32 1 120 232; call 121 60
narrate Age 788. Three years after the androids fell, the world has started, carefully, to grow back.
say trunks_a I'm going back one more time. Just to tell them it's over. Mom says I've earned a happy ending.
narrate He leaves the time machine packed and ready in the street, and goes home to sleep.
narrate In the morning, the machine is gone. Trunks is lying where it stood, and he doesn't wake up.
narrate Nobody ever learns what took it.
narrate Far below a ruined bunker, in a room that was never on any map, an empty incubator stands open.
unless_flag 341 epi_end
unless_flag 344 epi_end
unless_flag 370 epi_end
unless_flag 371 epi_end
narrate Eighteen remembered everything Gero took from her. So you are allowed to see the last thing he made.
run fs_start
stop
label epi_end
narrate The End.
narrate Some of Eighteen's memories were never found, and one choice could have gone another way. Remember everything, and something else may wake up.
run credits
stop
label finale_seen
# ---------- the ruined circus lot (log4/gen_ch10.py; flag 403)
list ch10_cache
if_flag 403 c10_empty
set_flag 403
narrate A wrecked food stall. Under the counter, somebody's emergency box: a Senzu Bean and an elixir.
say android18 Somebody was going to need these.
do call 129 11 1; call 129 7 1
stop
